# Local secrets for the editor's /api/translate function (auto-translate).
# This file is gitignored (via the `*.local` rule) — never committed. Safe to put a key here.
#
# IMPORTANT: `npm run dev` (plain Vite) does NOT run /api/translate. To exercise auto-translate,
# run `vercel dev` from this `editor/` directory (it serves the SPA + the function together).
#
# Provide a key for ONE path, then restart the dev server:

# Path A — Vercel AI Gateway (the shipped path; model anthropic/claude-haiku-4-5 routes through it):
AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY=

# Path B — direct Anthropic key. Only works once the /api/translate function is taught to use it
# directly (ask me to add that path). Then uncomment + fill:
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
